'''SC-X2'''<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|sc-x2|SC-X2}}</ref> was an astromech droid belonging to [[Bo Keevil]] of [[Ace Squadron]].<ref name="The High Tower" /> When Keevil flew his ship, ''[[Yellow Ace]]'', SC-X2 made calculations to assist whenever the ship reconfigured its wings. SC-X2 was highly reinforced to withstand most crashes and ship malfunctions.<ref name="Databank" /> It rolled along a track for better traction and direction control. Due to Bo Keevil's [[Kel Dor]] anatomy, SC-X2 carried emergency [[antiox breath mask]] parts inside its body, along with other gadgets.<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition" />

